  - "Never uses rune weapons, and abhors Splugorth bio-wizardry."
  - "Race: open to humans, all elven races, True Atlanteans, simvan, psi-stalkers, zembahk, dwarves, dragons and most humanoid D-bees. Demonic races, predators and most supernatural beings can never learn biomancy - the Splugorth and most of their servitor races, gargoyles, brodkil, trolls, gromek, most alien intelligences and the demons of Wormwood among them. Gods, demigods and godlings can, but few have."
  - "Starting gear also includes one weapon of choice (only 20% carry energy weapons) and up to 2D6 days'' worth of Gifts of Nature; many wear only a loincloth and/or cloak in the jungle."
