  - Skills renamed to the catalog: Lore: Monsters and Demons -> Lore: Demons
    & Monsters (25+15); Lore: Faerie -> Lore: Faeries & Creatures of Magic
    (25+20); Basic Math -> Mathematics: Basic (45+10); Track Animals -> Track
    & Trap Animals (20+10); W.P. Archery and Targeting -> W.P. Archery;
    Tracking -> Tracking (people).
  - Pilot: Horsemanship and riding exotic animal only (+14%) - the ink says
    +14% (rendered and checked). Stored on the catalog''s Horsemanship
    category as Horsemanship: General and Horsemanship: Exotic Animals with
    bonus 14. The Technical bonus applies to named skill kinds only, so it is
    a note, not a bonus.
  - Hand to Hand: Expert for one other skill, Martial Arts for two.
  - Money: 1D4x1000 credits plus 1D6x1000 in valuables; only the credits
    are stored.
  - Equipment: ceremonial clothes -> ceremonial-robe; water skin ->
    water-skin; food for 1D6 days -> food-rations x1d6; staff ->
    quarterstaff. The light M.D.C. armor is a choice of the two named
    (light-wood-armor, light-chitin-armor). The simple organic weapon is
    read as one of the lesser bio-weapons (enchanted wooden club, sword or
    spear) - a judgement. The weapon of choice is prose.
  - Healing Touch uses per day vary by level (3/4/5/6 at 1/5/8/12); not a
